U201_LOG t=0.1 ADMIT pri=2 q=1 'Bellmire is a hamlet now - a well dug, and a reason to stay.' | t=1.0 ADMIT pri=3 q=4 'V1 takes the oath as an elf mage (out of the old woods past the fields; sees in the dark). Hits hardest. Dies hardest.' | t=1.8 ADMIT pri=1 q=3 '52 souls live here.' | t=2.6 ADMIT pri=1 q=2 'V0 takes the oath as a dwarf knight (down from the hill mines; sees in the dark). Stout, shielded. Hard to kill, slow to finish a fight.' | t=8.8 ADMIT pri=1 q=4 'V2 takes the oath as a human cleric (valley-born, like most of Bellmire). Keeps the party upright longer than it deserves.' | t=11.1 ADMIT pri=1 q=5 'V3 takes the oath as an orc barbarian (came over the west road and stayed; sees in the dark). The most meat. Swings heavy, guards nothing.' | t=12.2 ADMIT pri=1 q=5 'Wren Fenwick, Hilda the Younger, Harl Quarryman, Osric Rivers, Rask Ashwood, Petra Fenwick, Cort of the Ford, Rask Thatcher set out for the dungeon.' | t=16.6 ADMIT pri=1 q=6 'Wolfgang_Amadeus_Mozart_X - a city in all but charter plays for 300 gold at most. The stakes rise as the town does.' | t=19.0 ADMIT pri=1 q=6 'Wolfgang_Amadeus_Mozart_X puts down 99999 gold they do not have - 12345 in the purse.' | t=19.8 ADMIT pri=1 q=6 'Someone walks out to look at the Old Footing.' | t=21.4 ADMIT pri=1 q=5 'Wolfgang_Amadeus_Mozart_X lays 300 gold on the table and dares Hildegard_von_Bingen_Qwer1 to throw. (!dice accept)'
